{"suttaId":"tha-ap56","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[4023,4047],"vripara":"25"},"segments":{"tha-ap56:0.3":"Gandhodakiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap56:1.1":"“Padumuttarabuddhassa, mahābodhimaho ahu;","tha-ap56:1.3":"Vicittaṃ ghaṭamādāya, gandhodakamadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap56:2.1":"“Nhānakāle ca bodhiyā, mahāmegho pavassatha;","tha-ap56:2.3":"Ninnādo ca mahā āsi, asaniyā phalantiyā.","tha-ap56:3.1":"“Tenevāsanivegena, tattha kālaṅkato [kālakato (sī. syā.)] ahaṃ [ahuṃ (sī.)];","tha-ap56:3.3":"Devaloke ṭhito santo, imā gāthā abhāsahaṃ.","tha-ap56:4.1":"“‘Aho buddho aho dhammo, aho no satthusampadā;","tha-ap56:4.3":"Kaḷevaraṃ [kalebaraṃ (sī.)] me patitaṃ, devaloke ramāmahaṃ.","tha-ap56:5.1":"“‘Ubbiddhaṃ bhavanaṃ mayhaṃ, satabhūmaṃ samuggataṃ;","tha-ap56:5.3":"Kaññāsatasahassāni, parivārenti maṃ sadā.","tha-ap56:6.1":"“‘Ābādhā me na vijjanti, soko mayhaṃ na vijjati;","tha-ap56:6.3":"Pariḷāhaṃ na passāmi, puññakammassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap56:7.1":"“‘Aṭṭhavīse kappasate, rājā saṃvasito ahuṃ;","tha-ap56:7.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo’.","tha-ap56:8.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap56:9.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā gandhodakiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap56:10.1":"Gandhodakiyattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2566,"to":2567,"paras":[{"para":2566,"vripara":"25","refs":["tha-ap56:1"],"lines":["So ekadivasaṃ attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>padumutarassā</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ vuttatthameva.","<b>Mahābodhimaho ahū</b>ti mahābodhirukkhassa pūjā ahosīti attho.","<b>Vicittaṃ ghaṭamādāyā</b>ti anekehi cittakammasuvaṇṇakammehi vicittaṃ sobhamānaṃ gandhodakapuṇṇaṃ ghaṭaṃ gahetvāti attho.","<b>Gandhodakamadāsahan</b>ti gandhodakaṃ adāsiṃ, ahaṃ gandhodakena abhisiñcinti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap56:1"],["tha-ap56:1"],["tha-ap56:1"],["tha-ap56:1"],["tha-ap56:1"]]},{"para":2567,"vripara":"26","refs":["tha-ap56:2"],"lines":["<b>Nhānakāle ca bodhiyā</b>ti bodhiyā pūjākaraṇasamayeti attho.","Sesaṃ uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap56:2"],["tha-ap56:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap56:1.1","mahābodhimaho ahū",0,2],["tha-ap56:1.3","vicittaṃ ghaṭamādāyā",0,3],["tha-ap56:1.3","gandhodakamadāsahaṃ",0,4],["tha-ap56:2.1","nhānakāle ca bodhiyā",1,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
